        "original_id": "2a661426-d43a-5e8b-861b-17a66fd287d0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stacey McClean, Biff Byford, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, Rochelle Wiseman\n- Groups and Music: S Club 8, S Club 7, Saxon, \"You're My Number One\", \"S Club Search\", \"S Club\"\n\nFacts:\n- \"You're My Number One\" is a song by S Club 7 that was released on 13 December 1999 as the fourth and final single from the band's debut album \"S Club\".\n- In 2001, the members of S Club 8, including Stacey McClean, Frankie Sandford, Jay Asforis, Daisy Evans, Calvin Goldspink, Aaron Renfree, Hannah Richings, and Rochelle Wiseman, were all in their early teens or younger when they were chosen from thousands of hopefuls on the television series \"S Club Search\".\n- Peter Rodney \"Biff\" Byford was born on 15 January 1951 and is an English singer best known as the lead singer of the heavy metal band Saxon.\n- Stacey McClean was born on 17 February 1989 and is an English solo singer.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
